{"articleNo":"180989","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=180989&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"『2017년 하반기 김제시 대학생 학자금대출 이자지원』사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2017.09.25","hit":"3093","attachments":[{"name":"하반기 안내문(홍보).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=180989&attachNo=5643"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;김제시 지</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">역 대학생들이 경제적 여건에 관계없이 의지와 실력에 따라 학업에 전념할 수 있는 환경 조성을 위한</span><strong><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">『</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2017</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년 하반기 김제시 대학생 학자금대출 이자지원</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">』</span></strong><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">사업을 아래와 같이 시행하니 해당학생은 참고바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">1</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">신청기간 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: 2017. 9. 24. ~ 10. 31.(5</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">주간</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">2</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원대상 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">공고일 기준 현재 부모 또는 학생이 김제시에 주소를 둔 대학 재학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">3</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원내용 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: ‘16. 1</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">~ ‘17. 9</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월에 한국장학재단에서 받은 학자금 대출이자 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">4</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">지원방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">한국장학재단에 지급하여 대상자별 대출금 상환</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M\">5</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M\">신 청 자 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: HY울릉도M; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY울릉도M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY울릉도M\">본인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">6</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">신청방법 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">온라인 신청</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">김제시청 홈페이지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">http://www.gimje.go.kr)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">⇒ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">홈페이지 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">→ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">배너 클릭 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">→ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">본인 인증 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">→ </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">대학생 학자금 이자 지원신청 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">7</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">문 의 처 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">김제시 인재양성과 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">☎</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">063-540-3864, 3714)</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
